# === PREFIXES ================================================================

# --- Basic ---
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# --- Domain specific ---
@prefix org: <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#> .  # The Organization Ontology

# --- Application specific ---
@prefix dseco: <https://w3id.org/dseco/ontology/> .
@prefix observable: <https://ontology.unifiedcyberontology.org/uco/observable/> .
@prefix core: <https://ontology.unifiedcyberontology.org/uco/core/> .
# kg with individuals is mykg
@prefix mykg: <https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/> .


#################################################################
#    Individuals
#################################################################

##################################################################
#
# facts are written one by one, so doing it line by line is really useful 
#  i do not manage ; or , . one line for one fact
#  then in the inference it will be factorized
#
##################################################################

# Hereunder, orgu for ZONE
<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/ORGU_int> a owl:NamedIndividual, org:OrganizationalUnit .
<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/ORGU_top> a owl:NamedIndividual, org:OrganizationalUnit .

# Hereunder, orgu for AS
<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/ORGU_malicious> a owl:NamedIndividual, org:OrganizationalUnit .
<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/ORGU_friendly> a owl:NamedIndividual, org:OrganizationalUnit .


<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/FQDN_auto.example.org> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual , dseco:FQDN .
