<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/FQDN_auto.example.org> dseco:is_in_zone <https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/ZONE_example.org> .
<https://w3id.org/dseco/mykg/FQDN_auto.example.org> dseco:hasName "auto.example.org."^^xsd:string .


